      "claim": "init/main.c calls rd_init(main_memory_start, RAMDISK*1024) under #ifdef RAMDISK and advances main_memory_start before mem_init.",
      "kind": "source",
      "source_url": "https://kernel.googlesource.com/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/nico/archive/+/v0.11/init/main.c",
